WEBVTT

00:00:01.320 --> 00:00:08.840
Oriku agreed to mediate with the villagers that rushed to him requesting that he bestow upon them the <i>senen</i>.

00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:17.420
Those influenced by Oriku's speech decided to train under him and aim to become enlightened.

00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:23.720
By order of the head, the elder Shachi from the Shichi School was ordered to investigate Kain and Muhika.

00:00:23.720 --> 00:00:28.120
He was told to eliminate them if it was found that they had indeed betrayed the Shichi School.

00:00:28.120 --> 00:00:31.640
Why are you joining in on this guy's little act?

00:00:31.640 --> 00:00:34.280
Like I said before, it just happened.

00:00:34.480 --> 00:00:39.700
Oriku then made Shachi take fake poison.

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:41.960
Welcome to the <i>Chikyou</i>*.

00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:41.960
*Name of their Sect.

00:00:41.960 --> 00:00:43.700
*Subbed by JellySubs*

00:00:41.960 --> 00:00:43.700
*Thanks to Angela for proofreading*

00:02:49.040 --> 00:02:52.660
Elder Shachi betrayed us.

00:02:52.900 --> 00:02:54.900
I want to hear the details.

00:02:54.900 --> 00:02:55.740
Kotora...

00:02:55.740 --> 00:02:56.380
Yes sir.

00:02:56.380 --> 00:02:58.060
This is what happened.

00:03:01.640 --> 00:03:06.600
We just bottled up a bill of indictment, I do not think it's a good idea to do anything...

00:03:06.600 --> 00:03:12.540
I think that not even the Human Effort Temple will tolerate it if this becomes an inter-sect dispute.

00:03:13.320 --> 00:03:14.860
Anyone else?

00:03:18.400 --> 00:03:20.160
Gather the fighters.

00:03:20.200 --> 00:03:25.200
I'm allocating ten "chikuki" level or above per group and I'll be taking command of all of the battalions.

00:03:25.360 --> 00:03:26.760
Head!

00:03:27.620 --> 00:03:31.040
I want them to travel in darkness and meet up here in three days.

00:03:31.040 --> 00:03:32.100
But...

00:03:32.380 --> 00:03:34.140
Make preparations!

00:03:43.120 --> 00:03:47.560
By the way, how did you find out about the <i>Chikyou</i>?

00:03:47.800 --> 00:03:51.300
We heard rumours of this place when passing through one of the villages.

00:03:51.300 --> 00:03:56.720
That there was a village where people without "senen", normal people, were arduously training.

00:03:57.160 --> 00:04:01.160
Indeed, everyone here is very enthusiastic.

00:04:01.440 --> 00:04:05.280
However, they still need coaches.

00:04:05.660 --> 00:04:12.380
If "shuushi" like the three of you could take up that role, we would be extremely grateful.

00:04:13.020 --> 00:04:16.340
Well then, please let me show you around the village.

00:04:16.340 --> 00:04:18.700
Is this gentleman with you as well?

00:04:24.400 --> 00:04:29.960
Oh, looks like the whole village is surrounded by strong <i>reiki</i>.

00:04:29.960 --> 00:04:32.880
Training here is twice as effective.

00:04:32.880 --> 00:04:34.880
Or possibly even more.

00:04:35.880 --> 00:04:38.360
Is that a ... <i>houdan</i>?

00:04:38.360 --> 00:04:40.760
It has a very peculiar shape, doesn't it.

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:43.380
It was created by our founder.

00:04:44.220 --> 00:04:48.440
This <i>houdan</i> converts great amounts of reiki into magical stones.

00:04:48.440 --> 00:04:51.920
Thanks to it, we are also able to purchase many artificial souls.

00:04:51.920 --> 00:04:56.640
So that's how you're able to achieve results faster than the other sects.

00:04:57.400 --> 00:05:00.900
We think the number of believers will keep growing.

00:05:01.080 --> 00:05:03.540
So we have to increase accommodations as well.

00:05:05.360 --> 00:05:07.260
Is everything alright?

00:05:07.260 --> 00:05:10.120
Actually, there's something we overheard.

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:11.740
And what would that be?

00:05:13.320 --> 00:05:15.580
Soul Cultivation <i>Ryuu</i> Sect?

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:19.060
That's the sect where the head of the Shichi School was from?

00:05:19.060 --> 00:05:24.160
In the Reiken Mountain, I once read a book about the origin of the core sects.

00:05:24.820 --> 00:05:30.620
According to the book, they are able to use the moon's and the stars' position and pull strength from that.

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:36.520
So basically, when we fight the Shichi School's Head we'll have to do it when you can't see the stars or the moon.

00:05:36.520 --> 00:05:38.580
Or we simply erase them...

00:05:39.840 --> 00:05:43.880
If we manage that then the sun might even rise from the west.

00:05:43.880 --> 00:05:45.260
I guess it might then.

00:05:46.160 --> 00:05:48.300
Are you being serious...?

00:05:56.360 --> 00:05:59.520
These villagers work very enthusiastically, don't they.

00:05:59.520 --> 00:06:02.020
Looks like their training is also progressing steadily.

00:06:02.120 --> 00:06:04.840
Even unbelievably fast for ordinary people.

00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:07.740
Looks like they can use their heads and life force well.

00:06:08.180 --> 00:06:10.460
Head and life force?...

00:06:12.180 --> 00:06:13.180
Don't tell me you...

00:06:13.940 --> 00:06:16.180
Did you use the Essence and Blood Boiling Technique?!

00:06:17.800 --> 00:06:21.880
That technique burns away a person's lifespan and turns it into power!

00:06:21.880 --> 00:06:24.120
Even the 10,000 Enlightened Alliance prohibited it ages ago.

00:06:24.120 --> 00:06:25.800
And why do you think that is?

00:06:26.320 --> 00:06:27.580
Because...

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:34.700
Because when you reach the limits of your training, you're able to overcome them using this technique.

00:06:34.760 --> 00:06:35.900
But...

00:06:36.260 --> 00:06:42.260
What they're against is the reason behind it, which for most is to use it as a shortcut for training.

00:06:42.620 --> 00:06:44.260
There are no shortcuts for training.

00:06:44.500 --> 00:06:47.340
And the Essence and Blood Boiling Technique itself is not sinful.

00:06:47.400 --> 00:06:50.960
I am making them use the Essence and Blood Boiling Technique, however...

00:06:50.960 --> 00:06:52.940
I'm not using it as a shortcut.

00:06:52.960 --> 00:06:56.720
Because this is a path that people have to take through life.

00:06:57.680 --> 00:07:05.960
For people like them that want to train to become enlightened but that have no <i>senen</i>, the only currency left to them is their lifespan.

00:07:05.960 --> 00:07:11.260
Even if they train using the artificial souls, it will take them over a hundred years just to become a Chikuki.

00:07:11.260 --> 00:07:14.140
And they don't have that time...

00:07:14.900 --> 00:07:21.880
The fastest way to increase our labour force is to use the Essence and Blood Boiling Technique to accelerate their training.

00:07:21.880 --> 00:07:25.160
But they're sacrificing their longevity.

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:27.160
Don't you think that's exploitation?

00:07:28.140 --> 00:07:31.600
When did you become such a nice person, Rei?

00:07:33.480 --> 00:07:38.060
They became stronger, built a mausoleum and even set up a communication relay system.

00:07:38.060 --> 00:07:45.720
And it's because of all these circumstances that we now have all these strong Shuushi wanting to become part of our sect.

00:07:45.720 --> 00:07:50.520
In order to make the sect bigger we have to gather Shuushi from all around.

00:07:50.520 --> 00:07:53.160
No matter how cruel or gruesome that may be.

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:57.260
But to become stronger that's what we'll have to be.

00:07:58.060 --> 00:08:00.980
This effects of this medicinal plant by itself are limited.

00:08:01.440 --> 00:08:02.520
However, if you combine this with...

00:08:02.520 --> 00:08:03.560
Founder-<i>sama</i>!

00:08:06.760 --> 00:08:11.220
Just a while ago three traveling <i>Shuushis </i>have expressed wanting to join our sect.

00:08:11.360 --> 00:08:18.620
One of them said that there is a large group of fighters from the Shichi School gathered east of the village.

00:08:18.620 --> 00:08:19.560
So, they're finally here.

00:08:23.240 --> 00:08:25.360
There’s one <i>houdan</i> in the center of the village.

00:08:25.430 --> 00:08:29.280
It looks like they have everything needed for a sect here.

00:08:30.340 --> 00:08:32.880
There are over ten <i>Renki Shuushi</i>.

00:08:32.960 --> 00:08:35.990
And around four to five that are close to <i>Shikuki</i> level.

00:08:36.500 --> 00:08:40.130
I can't believe they were able to make this much progress in just a month...

00:08:40.330 --> 00:08:43.100
This only amounts to about 30% of what we aim to achieve.

00:08:43.100 --> 00:08:50.520
However, if we are to actually fight them, then we should call for around another fifty fighters.

00:08:50.520 --> 00:08:51.100
I agree.

00:08:59.750 --> 00:09:01.840
When will be battalion we sent for arrive?

00:09:02.320 --> 00:09:03.460
Tomorrow morning...

00:09:04.600 --> 00:09:06.470
We gain nothing from being impatient.

00:09:06.840 --> 00:09:09.140
Just get everyone to rest for now.

00:09:11.070 --> 00:09:11.860
Where are you headed?

00:09:12.980 --> 00:09:13.860
I'm going to meet up with someone.

00:09:13.970 --> 00:09:15.580
Please let me accompany you.

00:09:15.580 --> 00:09:17.200
No, I'll be fine by myself.

00:09:31.370 --> 00:09:32.880
Elder Shachi, huh...

00:09:35.300 --> 00:09:37.040
It's been about a month, hasn't it.

00:09:37.280 --> 00:09:39.040
Let's hear your excuse.

00:09:39.520 --> 00:09:42.880
I have nothing to say to you.

00:09:42.880 --> 00:09:44.970
So you're the bait...

00:09:44.970 --> 00:09:47.440
No, I came alone.

00:09:47.440 --> 00:09:51.300
That might just be what you think.

00:09:51.300 --> 00:09:52.310
Possibly.

00:09:52.310 --> 00:09:54.310
If that's the case then it's alright.

00:09:55.820 --> 00:10:00.140
I established the Shichi School and took root in <i>Todoufu</i>.

00:10:00.140 --> 00:10:04.010
However, there was already a school there called the <i>Gyokuhei</i> School.

00:10:04.090 --> 00:10:06.570
There was sudden conflict.

00:10:06.950 --> 00:10:09.970
I went to their headquarters alone.

00:10:10.560 --> 00:10:13.130
The enemies were a few dozens of <i>Shuushi</i>.

00:10:13.220 --> 00:10:16.010
I fought for three days and three nights.

00:10:16.490 --> 00:10:22.100
I sustained serious injuries but... during that battle, the deepest secrets of the <i>Sezu</i> awoke within me.

00:10:23.260 --> 00:10:27.170
To think that at this age I would still have to fight...

00:10:27.220 --> 00:10:30.860
Please return to the Shichi School immediately, Head.

00:10:31.650 --> 00:10:36.090
This time, the opponent is not someone you can beat.

00:10:36.690 --> 00:10:38.090
What!?

00:10:39.900 --> 00:10:41.690
Are you telling me retreat?

00:10:41.690 --> 00:10:44.130
To leave and not do anything?

00:10:44.540 --> 00:10:46.640
It's only been a month, however...

00:10:46.640 --> 00:10:50.480
I've witnessed this village's sudden growth with my own eyes.

00:10:50.640 --> 00:10:54.050
The founder here is a lot younger than me.

00:10:54.050 --> 00:10:56.180
However, he's the real deal.

00:10:56.320 --> 00:10:59.780
He has the power and knowledge to accomplish anything.

00:11:00.250 --> 00:11:05.610
Even the <i>Shuushi</i> that are lost find enlightenment from just a few of his words.

00:11:06.410 --> 00:11:07.680
Even me...

00:11:09.940 --> 00:11:11.120
I beg you!

00:11:11.120 --> 00:11:12.930
Please withdraw the soldiers.

00:11:12.970 --> 00:11:17.360
Even me meeting up with you like this is going beyond my limit.

00:11:18.580 --> 00:11:20.620
Can you get the founder to meet up with me?

00:11:21.260 --> 00:11:22.940
What do you plan to do if you meet him?

00:11:22.940 --> 00:11:24.940
I don't know yet...

00:11:25.620 --> 00:11:28.920
As things are, I can't even give them an explanation.

00:11:29.160 --> 00:11:31.410
I'm sure you don't need to explain anything.

00:11:32.740 --> 00:11:39.900
It's not like everything has gone according to plan since you established the Shichi School.

00:11:40.080 --> 00:11:43.840
Were there never times when you had no choice but to compromise?

00:11:44.060 --> 00:11:48.620
Do you always have to explain yourself every time there's a setback?

00:11:48.620 --> 00:11:50.620
Setbacks?!

00:11:50.960 --> 00:11:59.100
Back then, when the Shichi School wasn't so stable, it was always a target of false accusations.

00:11:59.300 --> 00:12:05.460
You would usually say that you were going to have a chat with them and simply leave.

00:12:06.380 --> 00:12:08.970
You never gave us any explanation.

00:12:08.970 --> 00:12:10.970
And we never asked for one.

00:12:11.570 --> 00:12:15.690
While drinking sake, you promised to us

00:12:15.690 --> 00:12:18.460
that you would continue widening the path of development.

00:12:18.460 --> 00:12:25.540
That you would affiliate the Shichi School to the 10,000 Enlightened Alliance in order to bring more glory to ways of our sect.

00:12:26.930 --> 00:12:29.040
Everyone trusts you.

00:12:29.980 --> 00:12:32.640
I can't just quietly go home.

00:12:32.930 --> 00:12:35.720
Your opponent is a sacred disciple of the Five Suppressors.

00:12:35.720 --> 00:12:41.610
If you make Reiken Sect your enemy, there's a possibility that they might even destroy the Shichi School.

00:12:42.480 --> 00:12:45.120
Please go back to the Shichi School.

00:12:45.500 --> 00:12:47.920
That's all I can say.

00:12:52.840 --> 00:12:56.400
Please search for the right path to your noble ancestry.

00:13:12.970 --> 00:13:14.300
Who's there?!

00:13:23.610 --> 00:13:25.690
There was definitely someone here.

00:13:26.530 --> 00:13:28.960
No, there's still someone here.

00:13:32.860 --> 00:13:34.220
I let him escape, huh...

00:13:34.220 --> 00:13:36.480
There's no need to be so nervous.

00:13:39.650 --> 00:13:41.140
Astral Projection!

00:13:41.140 --> 00:13:42.160
Exactly.

00:13:42.160 --> 00:13:44.860
I'm still in a very faraway place.

00:13:45.060 --> 00:13:48.120
So it's normal that you can't find me.

00:13:48.380 --> 00:13:50.280
What are you after?

00:13:50.280 --> 00:13:52.700
I don't even get a greeting?

00:13:52.700 --> 00:13:55.770
If you show yourself I shall do so.

00:13:55.770 --> 00:13:58.320
Why are you targeting the Shichi School?

00:13:58.730 --> 00:14:00.620
More importantly, Mr. Head of School,

00:14:00.620 --> 00:14:03.120
I have something interesting to talk to you about.

00:14:03.120 --> 00:14:03.820
What?

00:14:03.820 --> 00:14:05.820
I'll go straight to the point.

00:14:06.130 --> 00:14:08.090
Will you not join our <i>Chikyou</i> Sect?

00:14:16.520 --> 00:14:19.780
It's been quite a while since I heard such a funny joke.

00:14:20.010 --> 00:14:26.860
I'm sure you can imagine the future prospects of the <i>Chikyou</i> Sect from the rate of progress so far.

00:14:26.860 --> 00:14:29.450
I can't see how this is a bad deal...

00:14:29.450 --> 00:14:35.100
With my kind of power, apart from the very top ones, I can join any Sect I please.

00:14:35.100 --> 00:14:40.020
And honestly, I have received various requests throughout the years.

00:14:40.020 --> 00:14:43.690
So you're saying that you have no intentions of following someone else?

00:14:44.010 --> 00:14:48.840
Don't you think you should be more worried about yourself?

00:14:48.840 --> 00:14:50.300
Myself?

00:14:50.300 --> 00:14:53.460
I did some research on you.

00:14:53.460 --> 00:15:03.810
The fact that you created your own sect and were able to go this far in just few months shows that you're no ordinary Shuushi.

00:15:03.810 --> 00:15:08.850
However, you went and used something you shouldn't have...

00:15:09.370 --> 00:15:11.640
The Essence and Blood Boiling Technique!

00:15:12.560 --> 00:15:14.180
So you noticed...

00:15:14.450 --> 00:15:21.840
For the top sects, their reputation is thousands of times more important than hundreds of magical stones.

00:15:21.840 --> 00:15:27.400
What do you think would happen if they found out that one of their disciples was using that heretic technique?

00:15:27.880 --> 00:15:30.680
You're sharper than I thought.

00:15:31.860 --> 00:15:33.770
Shall we come to an agreement?

00:15:34.880 --> 00:15:38.960
I'll even disregard Elder Kein and Shachi's betrayal.

00:15:38.960 --> 00:15:43.280
From now on we will not interfere with each other nor do anything to provoke the other.

00:15:43.280 --> 00:15:46.640
So you're suggesting that we turn a blind eye at each other's affairs?

00:15:47.290 --> 00:15:49.240
I'm sure you can't think it a bad deal.

00:15:49.240 --> 00:15:50.930
I'm not so sure...

00:15:50.930 --> 00:15:56.160
If I let you go now you might simply send a letter of indictment, just like I did.

00:16:01.300 --> 00:16:03.000
Where do you think you're going?

00:16:04.570 --> 00:16:06.650
So it comes down to this after all...

00:16:07.580 --> 00:16:09.700
Alright then, I'll show you!

00:16:09.700 --> 00:16:11.850
The power of a <i>Kyotan</i>.

00:16:23.060 --> 00:16:25.880
You put up a barrier instantly.

00:16:25.880 --> 00:16:27.880
I wouldn't expect any less from a <i>Kyotan</i>.

00:16:32.050 --> 00:16:34.680
I see you finally showed yourself.

00:16:34.680 --> 00:16:36.540
Thank you, Rei.

00:16:36.540 --> 00:16:39.520
Everything's good here now so you can head back.

00:16:39.520 --> 00:16:40.880
Alright, alright...

00:16:40.880 --> 00:16:43.620
You're so self-serving sometimes.

00:16:44.580 --> 00:16:48.610
From now on it will be just the two of us fighting, Mr. Head of School.

00:16:48.610 --> 00:16:52.980
If I win I'll have you and everyone else in the Shichi School join the Chikyou Sect.

00:16:53.210 --> 00:16:54.200
It will ever happen!

00:17:01.730 --> 00:17:03.680
How is this one on one?!

00:17:41.530 --> 00:17:44.720
<i>Sei, Jin, Kai.</i>

00:18:05.650 --> 00:18:06.840
<i>San.</i>

00:18:34.010 --> 00:18:37.160
Blood was spilt, and in vain.

00:18:38.450 --> 00:18:40.360
It's all your fault!

00:18:40.360 --> 00:18:44.000
You didn't really think these guys would be worthy opponents, did you?

00:18:44.370 --> 00:18:46.920
Show yourself already!

00:19:06.460 --> 00:19:08.770
Wasn't this supposed to be a one on one fight?

00:19:08.770 --> 00:19:11.940
Is this how a sacred disciple of the Five Suppressor Sects fights?

00:19:13.570 --> 00:19:17.290
Did you seriously think I'd show myself?

00:19:18.180 --> 00:19:20.300
I overestimated you...

00:19:20.730 --> 00:19:24.770
I was expecting a more dignifying fight from someone of a renowned sect, but...

00:19:26.260 --> 00:19:32.220
If that's how you're playing it then I'll just have to destroy you along with the whole village.

00:19:39.650 --> 00:19:41.200
There's not enough power!

00:19:44.340 --> 00:19:45.780
I can't see the stars?!

00:20:02.720 --> 00:20:05.010
Do you like it?

00:20:06.290 --> 00:20:10.160
If there are no stars, your power halves.

00:20:11.240 --> 00:20:14.260
Your power is mysterious and magnificent.

00:20:14.410 --> 00:20:19.060
But to use it you need a huge amount of energy.

00:20:19.300 --> 00:20:21.940
And your power alone isn't enough.

00:20:22.660 --> 00:20:29.520
The greater part of that power comes from the moon's brightness as well as the stars.

00:20:29.650 --> 00:20:32.290
You were part of the Soul Cultivation <i>Ryuu</i> School!

00:20:33.770 --> 00:20:40.220
If you can find out that I'm originally from a famous sect, then you should also be able to find out my views and area of study,

00:20:40.220 --> 00:20:46.300
and understand that someone like you who comes from a common sect and struggles with virtue is no match for me.

00:20:46.300 --> 00:20:47.730
What!?

00:20:48.290 --> 00:20:53.840
The reason behind your confidence is probably the seven luminaries*, am I wrong?

00:20:48.290 --> 00:20:53.840
*Seven Luminaries: sun, moon, Mercury, Venus, Mars, Jupiter and Saturn (also the origin of the name of the 7 days of the week in Japanese).

00:20:54.380 --> 00:21:00.490
After you built on that incomplete technique it finally became the <i>Shichiseiketsu</i>.

00:21:00.490 --> 00:21:02.700
And what you aimed for was not a bad idea.

00:21:02.960 --> 00:21:09.020
However, if the basic fundamentals are the same, then if you put myself in my adversary's shoes,

00:21:09.020 --> 00:21:11.840
your nature and fighting style becomes obvious.

00:21:11.840 --> 00:21:18.360
Oh, if you have that kind of talent, then why did you set me up like that?

00:21:18.360 --> 00:21:21.340
Fight me fair and square!

00:21:33.360 --> 00:21:36.180
Please back down! I don't want to kill you!

00:21:36.180 --> 00:21:39.100
Listen to yourself, you traitor!

00:21:46.200 --> 00:21:48.290
Die, you pig!

00:22:08.210 --> 00:22:09.290
You!
